  "description": "A .NET-10 port of Mono.Cecil 0.11.5: a fully managed library for reading, writing, and rewriting .NET assemblies, IL, metadata, and debug symbols (portable PDB, native PDB, and Mono MDB). Provides a drop-in replacement for the Mono.Cecil NuGet package after a namespace find/replace (Mono.Cecil -> CodeBrix.AssemblyTools). Merges Mono.Cecil, Mono.Cecil.Rocks, Mono.Cecil.Pdb, and Mono.Cecil.Mdb into one assembly.",
